OL,3,GNEWSALondon borough is Britain's
OL,4,Ahappiest, survey finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichmond upon Thames has been named as
OL,7,Fthe happiest place to live in Britain
OL,8,Fin an annual survey.
OL,10,FResidents of the south-west London
OL,11,Fborough have easy access to central
OL,12,FLondon and strolls along the Thames on
OL,13,Ftheir doorstep, as well as boutiques,
OL,14,Fcafes and opportunities to spot roaming
OL,15,Fdeer in their local parks.
