OL,3,GNEWSALondon borough is Britain's
OL,4,Ahappiest, survey finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichmond ranked particularly highly
OL,7,Facross several aspects of local life in
OL,8,FRightmove's "happy at home index",
OL,9,Fincluding access to nature and green
OL,10,Fspaces, essential local services, shops
OL,11,Fand restaurants, employment
OL,12,Fopportunities as well as residents'
OL,13,Fpride in their area.
OL,15,FBut, living there comes at a cost, with
OL,16,Fthe average asking price for a home in
OL,17,Fthe borough standing at more than #1m.
